OL,3,GNEWSACommunity celebrates restored
OL,4,A1,000-year-old church
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade I listed round-tower church has
OL,7,Fbeen restored after a community raised
OL,8,Fabout #850,000 for it to be repaired.
OL,10,FSt Peter's Church in Forncett, Norfolk,
OL,11,Fwhich is thought to be more than 1,000
OL,12,Fyears old, had holes in its roof and
OL,13,Fcracks in its walls.
OL,15,FThe Friends of St Peter's organised
OL,16,Fbake sales, quizzes and Christmas
OL,17,Fmarkets to fundraise more than #50,000
OL,18,Ffor the works, alongside securing
OL,19,Fnearly #800,000 through National
OL,20,FLottery funding and other grants.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
